{
  "type": "doc",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A missing WHERE in an UPDATE intended for one order can change others too. A DELETE without conditions can erase all rows."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I enabled QueryPie’s missing-condition guard and tested scoped and unscoped SQL with modification/deletion privileges, then checked the remaining data."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Preparing Update and Delete Privileges"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "DML Guard Lab held fictional work orders 35001 and 35002 PENDING, and 35003 TEMPORARY."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Demo Developer had SELECT, UPDATE, and DELETE, verified in the user view. I kept them throughout to isolate the WHERE guard."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/prevent-unsafe-sql/01.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 1. Lab user has read, update, and delete privileges.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 1. Lab user has read, update, and delete privileges."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Enabling WHERE Protection"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In Databases → General → Configurations, I switched "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Block UPDATE/DELETE without WHERE"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " On and saved. This global administrator option restricts UPDATE and DELETE without WHERE."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/prevent-unsafe-sql/02.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 2. Blocking UPDATE and DELETE with missing WHERE.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 2. Blocking UPDATE and DELETE with missing WHERE."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "After confirming the saved setting, I opened a fresh developer connection; all later changes used that connection."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A Single-Row UPDATE Works"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I set order 35001 to CHECKED with WHERE work_id = 35001. Results showed "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "1 Rows updated."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/prevent-unsafe-sql/03.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 3. Scoped UPDATE succeeds and changes one row.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 3. Scoped UPDATE succeeds and changes one row."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I removed only WHERE from the same UPDATE, leaving the CHECKED assignment unchanged but no target condition."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Execution opened the "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Query execution blocked"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " dialog with the explanation "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "There is no WHERE clause found"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", confirming QueryPie blocked the missing condition."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/prevent-unsafe-sql/04.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 4. UPDATE without WHERE is blocked with an explanation.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 4. UPDATE without WHERE is blocked with an explanation."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "After closing the dialog, 35001 alone was CHECKED; 35002 remained PENDING and 35003 TEMPORARY. The unscoped UPDATE had no effect."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/prevent-unsafe-sql/05.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 5. Three rows remain, with the other two unchanged.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 5. Three rows remain, with the other two unchanged."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Same Distinction for DELETE"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I deleted TEMPORARY order 35003 using WHERE work_id = 35003, which returned "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "1 Rows deleted."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". The targeted deletion succeeded."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/prevent-unsafe-sql/06.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 6. DELETE targeting 35003 removes just that row.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 6. DELETE targeting 35003 removes just that row."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "DELETE FROM ep35_guard.work_orders; without WHERE again opened Query execution blocked, citing the absent condition."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/prevent-unsafe-sql/07.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 7. Unconditional all-row DELETE is blocked too.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 7. Unconditional all-row DELETE is blocked too."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "35001 CHECKED and 35002 PENDING remained. Only deliberately deleted 35003 was gone."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/prevent-unsafe-sql/08.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 8. Both remaining orders are still readable after the block.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 8. Both remaining orders are still readable after the block."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Adding Mistake Protection to Work Privileges"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Staff can retain necessary change privileges while missing WHERE is blocked separately. The same user/connection could execute targeted SQL but not unscoped SQL."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This adds a safeguard to routine changes: configure centrally and show the reason at execution. It helps prevent a single-order task from affecting a wider range by mistake."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The lab used QueryPie Community 11.6.7/MySQL 8.0.42 web SQL editor and fictional data. Afterward, I restored data and the global option to its previous Off state."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Reference: "
        },
